me())).isEqualTo(DefaultChannelIdTest.class);\n    }\n}\n"}}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "call_DeF6TRUfRMT0WZk57cV79pqN|fc_01ddf0e646054b84016ad20dea2ad487d182ae46638a0d8040", "name": "write", "arguments": {"path": "tests/src/org.apache.pulsar/pulsar-client-all/4.2.5/src/test/java/org_apache_pulsar/pulsar_client_all/ObjectEncoderOutputStreamTest.java", "content": "/*\n * Copyright and related rights waived via CC0\n *\n * You should have received a copy of the CC0 legalcode along with this\n * work. If not, see <http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/>.\n */\npackage org_apache_pulsar.pulsar_client_all;\n\nimport static org.assertj.core.api.Assertions.assertThat;\n\nimport java.io.ByteArrayInputStream;\nimport java.io.ByteArrayOutputStream;\n\nimport org.apache.pulsar.shade.io.netty.handler.codec.serialization.ObjectDecoderInputStream;\nimport org.apache.pulsar.shade.io.netty.handler.codec.serialization.ObjectEncoderOutputStream;\nimport org.junit.jupiter.api.Test;\n\n@SuppressWarnings(\"deprecation\")\npublic class ObjectEncoderOutputStreamTest {\n    @Test\n    void writesFramedSerializedObjects() throws Exception {\n        final ByteArrayOutputStream bytes = new ByteArrayOutputStream();\n        try (ObjectEncoderOutputStream output = new ObjectEncoderOutputStream(bytes)) {\n            output.writeObject(\"pulsar\");\n        }\n\n        try (ObjectDecoderInputStream input = new ObjectDecoderInputStream(\n                new ByteArrayInputStream(bytes.toByteArray()))) {\n            assertThat(input.readObject()).isEqualTo(\"pulsar\");\n        }\n    }\n}\n"}}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "call_z9VUMMqdM8JB66CkmBEJxWed|fc_01ddf0e646054b84016ad20dea2adc87d18c6dacb6a14d1a0e", "name": "write", "arguments": {"path": "tests/src/org.apache.pulsar/pulsar-client-all/4.2.5/src/test/java/org_apache_pulsar/pulsar_client_all/ObjectDecoderInputStreamTest.java", "content": "/*\n * Copyright and related rights waived via CC0\n *\n * You should have received a copy 