.class);\n    }\n\n    public interface EchoService {\n"},{"oldText":"    public static final class Message {\n        private long id;\n        private String payload;\n\n        public Message() {\n        }\n    }\n}\n","newText":"    public static final class Message {\n        private long id;\n        private String payload;\n\n        public Message() {\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static final class DefaultedMessage {\n        public String text = \"created\";\n        public int count = 3;\n    }\n\n    @AvroEncode(using = EncodedValueEncoding.class)\n    public static final class EncodedValue {\n        private final String value;\n\n        public EncodedValue() {\n            this(\"default\");\n        }\n\n        public EncodedValue(String configuredValue) {\n            value = configuredValue;\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static final class EncodedMessage {\n        @AvroEncode(using = EncodedValueEncoding.class)\n        public EncodedValue value = new EncodedValue(\"field\");\n    }\n\n    public static final class EncodedValueEncoding extends CustomEncoding<EncodedValue> {\n        public EncodedValueEncoding() {\n            schema = Schema.create(Schema.Type.STRING);\n        }\n\n        @Override\n        protected void write(Object datum, Encoder output) throws IOException {\n            output.writeString(((EncodedValue) datum).value);\n        }\n\n        @Override\n        protected EncodedValue read(Object reuse, Decoder input) throws IOException {\n            return new EncodedValue(input.readString().toString());\n        }\n    }\n}\n"}]}
